3. Connect button

// wire it up to pin 39 and 40 
// check the button is working 
// not pressed
pinctrl get 21
21: ip    -- | hi // GPIO21 = input

// pressed
pinctrl get 21
21: ip    -- | lo // GPIO21 = input

// buttom test py file nano 
